\versionid guide.but, the help file of hlptest

This is the help file that the tests of the WinHelp viewer read. See
\k{start} to begin, or \k{reference} for the details.

\C{start} Getting started

The \i{widget} is a small window. To make one, click \e{New Widget}
on the \i{File menu}. See \k{making} for the steps.

\H{making} Making a widget

Do these steps:

\n Click \e{File}.

\n Click \e{New Widget}.

\n Type a name, and then click \e{OK}.

The widget then shows its \i{frame}, as \k{reference} tells.

\C{reference} Reference

\H{api} The widget functions

\c CreateWidget(name, flags);
\c DestroyWidget(widget);

\b \cw{CreateWidget} makes a widget.

\b \cw{DestroyWidget} removes it.

\IM{widget} widget
